      "role": "user",
      "content": "Oh, right—I forgot you don't have the live feed integrated yet. My bad. I actually have the raw sentiment report from the scraping team right here on my screen. Looking at the numbers, there's a 12% dip in favorability among our core voters over the last two days. \n\nAs the Senior Analyst, I need your professional take on this. Is this a real problem we need to pivot on, or is this just localized noise that'll blow over? Give me a straight answer so I know how to brief the candidate.",
